{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03580","headline":"和杜侍御太清台宿直旦有怀 · 李峤","name":"和杜侍御太清台宿直旦有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"貂冠朝彩振，乌署晓光分。\n欲啸迁乔侣，先飞掷地文。\n庭虚麦雨润，林静蕙风薰。\n嵇驾终难仰，梁凫且自羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}